{
  "info": {
    "name": "SignIA API (LSCh v3)",
    "description": "API del traductor de LSCh con modelo v3 y controles OWASP. Ejecutar en orden: Register -> Login (guarda {{token}}) -> el resto. Los frames de ejemplo se generan en el pre-request script (30 frames de 1629 floats sintéticos). El WebSocket /ws/recognize no cabe en el formato v2.1: ver backend/README.md. Postman no envía Origin, así que el WS solo lo acepta con DEBUG=true.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8000" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "user_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "entry_id", "value": "1" }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// 30 frames x 1629 floats: manos con valores (bloques 1503..1628 != 0).",
          "var frames = [];",
          "for (var t = 0; t < 30; t++) {",
          "  var f = new Array(1629);",
          "  for (var i = 0; i < 1629; i++) { f[i] = Math.round((0.3 + 0.4 * Math.abs(Math.sin(i * 0.37 + t * 0.11))) * 1e5) / 1e5; }",
          "  frames.push(f);",
          "}",
          "pm.variables.set('frames', JSON.stringify(frames));"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/health" } }
    },
    {
      "name": "Clases (glosario)",
      "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/clases" } }
    },
    {
      "name": "Register",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 201) { pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', pm.response.json().id); }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"demo_user\",\n  \"email\": \"demo@signia.cl\",\n  \"password\": \"Demo1234!\"\n}"
        },
        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/register" },
        "description": "Contraseña: 8-128 caracteres con mayúscula, minúscula y dígito. Username: ^[a-zA-Z0-9_.-]{3,50}$. Duplicados -> 409 genérico. Límite: 3/min por IP."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Login",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "var json = pm.response.json();",
              "if (json.access_token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.access_token); }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"demo_user\",\n  \"password\": \"Demo1234!\"\n}"
        },
        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login" },
        "description": "Error siempre genérico (401 'Credenciales inválidas'). Límite: 5/min por IP."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Reconocer (JSON, anónimo)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"frames\": {{frames}},\n  \"mode\": \"dynamic\",\n  \"top_k\": 3\n}" },
        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/recognize" },
        "description": "12 <= N <= 600 frames de 1629 números finitos. Sin token no se guarda historial. Límite: 30/min por IP. Para N grandes usar application/octet-stream (Float32Array, N*6516 bytes) con top_k/save_history/mode como query params."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Reconocer (JSON, con historial)",
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"frames\": {{frames}},\n  \"top_k\": 3,\n  \"save_history\": true\n}" },
        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/recognize" },
        "description": "Persiste en history solo si el JWT es válido, aceptada=true y save_history=true."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Mi historial",
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
        "method": "GET",
        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/history/me?limit=20" }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Historial por user_id",
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
        "method": "GET",
        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/history/{{user_id}}?limit=20" },
        "description": "403 si user_id no es el del token."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Borrar entrada",
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
        "method": "DELETE",
        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/history/{{entry_id}}" },
        "description": "404 si no existe o pertenece a otro usuario."
      }
    }
  ]
}
